      "revision": 1372371594,
      "text": "Afrostyrax lepidophyllus is a species of flowering plant in the family Huaceae. It is found in Cameroon, the Central African Republic, the Republic of the Congo, the Democratic Republic of the Congo, Gabon, and Ghana. It is threatened by habitat loss."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Afrostyrax lepidophyllus",
